# Fair Arcade Platform — Environment Configuration (Example)
#
# IMPORTANT: This project requires NO environment variables for v1.
# All state is persisted client-side in localStorage and there is no
# external API, database, or payment provider involved.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` only if you extend the project with a
# persistence/auth layer. Never commit real values to the repository.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — future database layer (not used by v1)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/fairacade"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — future authentication (not used by v1)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AUTH_SECRET="replace-with-a-random-32-byte-secret"
# AUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAFETY NOTE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Coins are a purely fictional in-app counter with NO monetary value.
# Do NOT add payment, cash-out, crypto, or real-money-wagering providers.
